Hi all

My wife made a sheet we both find pretty useful for keeping notes about
our current Nethack games.  It includes space to list off intrinsics
gained, dungeon levels, location of altars, intended conducts, and some
space for miscellaneous notes.  I find it very helpful when I return to a
game after a few days off -- it lets me figure out what's going on with
that character very quickly.  It also makes a fun souvenir after the game
is over (there's a DYWYPI? line at the end to note how the game ended.)
It's meant to be printed as a double-sided sheet.

